      "title": "Resolving Password Reset Failures and Token Errors in SSO Integration",
      "content_summary": "Addresses missing password reset emails, duplicate account creation, and invalid token errors within the Role Manager and SSO Integration Module, focusing on certificate and configuration issues.",
      "content_body": "When users report missing password reset emails or receive invalid token errors, first verify the SSO Integration Module's certificate validity. Expired certificates often block secure email dispatch and token generation, leading to failed authentication flows. Check for customer configuration errors, particularly in the Role Manager settings that may cause duplicate account creation during recovery attempts. Renew any expired certificates immediately and adjust the customer's configuration to align with standard identity protocols. Confirm that the resolution resolves both the token errors and email delivery issues before closing the ticket."
